# Habit Tracker
A week of checkboxes for each habit:  tick a day when you did it.
Each habit counts its days, and its streak:  the most days in a row you kept it up.

## A habit
Its name, a yes or no for each day of the week, and what they add up to.
Each habit is its own element on the page, `<habit-tracker-habit>`.

<view "habit">
	<property "name">text</>

	<group "days" description="A yes or no for each day of the week"/>
	<property "monday">yes or no</>
	<property "tuesday">yes or no</>
	<property "wednesday">yes or no</>
	<property "thursday">yes or no</>
	<property "friday">yes or no</>
	<property "saturday">yes or no</>
	<property "sunday">yes or no</>

	<group "totals" description="Worked out from its days, again as each one is ticked"/>
	<property "days" description="Its week as one list, Monday first">
		[the monday, the tuesday, the wednesday, the thursday, the friday, the saturday, the sunday]
	</property>
	<property "count" description="How many days this week it was done">the number of days in the days where it is yes</>
	<property "streak" description="The most days in a row it was done">
		set run to 0
		set best to 0
		for day in the days
			if day is yes
				set run to run + 1
				if run > best: set best to run
			otherwise
				set run to 0
		return best
	</property>

	<draw description="A form of its own, bound to it:  ticking a day, or typing a name, changes the habit">
		<segment>
			<form value={it}>
				<stack spacing="sm">
					<stack direction="horizontal" justify="between">
						<input name="name" aria-label="Habit" appearance="transparent"/>
						<labels>
							<label>{the count} days</label>
							<label color="orange" icon="fire">{the streak} in a row</label>
						</labels>
					</stack>
					<stack direction="horizontal" justify="between" wrap>
						<checkbox name="monday" label="Mon"/>
						<checkbox name="tuesday" label="Tue"/>
						<checkbox name="wednesday" label="Wed"/>
						<checkbox name="thursday" label="Thu"/>
						<checkbox name="friday" label="Fri"/>
						<checkbox name="saturday" label="Sat"/>
						<checkbox name="sunday" label="Sun"/>
					</stack>
				</stack>
			</form>
		</segment>
	</draw>

	<test "streaks">
		set the habit to a new habit with name = "Read", monday = yes, tuesday = yes, thursday = yes
		the habit's count should be 3
		the habit's streak should be 2
		set the habit's wednesday to yes
		the habit's streak should be 4
	</test>
</view>

## The week
The habits, one under the other:  `<habit-tracker-week>`, around its habits' elements.

<view "week" template="viewable list of habits">
	<spell>
		// on the page, its habits can be dragged to another place
		- its items can be reordered immediately
	</spell>
	<draw description="Its habits one under the other;  while it's empty, a line saying so">
		<stack spacing="sm">
			<if it is empty>
				<text color="grey">No habits yet:  add one above</text>
			</if>
			<children/>
		</stack>
	</draw>
</view>
<spell>
	// a habit is in one week
	a habit belongs to one week
</spell>

## The tracker
The new habit's field, then a habit a row.

<app "habit tracker">
	<property "habits">a new week</>
	<property "draft" description="The next habit's name, as the new habit's field holds it">text</>

	<action "create it" description="A new tracker starts with three habits, a few days ticked">
		add (a new habit with name = "Read", monday = yes, tuesday = yes, wednesday = yes, friday = yes) to the habits
		add (a new habit with name = "Walk", tuesday = yes, wednesday = yes, thursday = yes, friday = yes) to the habits
		add (a new habit with name = "Stretch", monday = yes, saturday = yes) to the habits
	</action>

	<action "add the draft" description="The draft, as a new habit at the end;  the field empties">
		if the draft is "" return
		add (a new habit with name = the draft) to the habits
		clear the draft
	</action>

	<draw>
		<container text>
			<stack>
				<header level="2">This week</header>
				<form value={it}>
					<input name="draft" placeholder="A habit to keep, e.g. Read" aria-label="New habit" fluid action>
						<button slot="action" color="primary" disabled={the draft is ""} onClick={add the draft}>Add</button>
					</input>
				</form>
				{draw the habits}
			</stack>
		</container>
	</draw>
</app>
